    <div class="cc26-storytext">
        <blockquote class="cc26-pull">Three or four coins a month.</blockquote>
        <p>That's how it started — a small side hustle, selling three or four coins a month. It grew, and grew, into the business that exists today. And the name stuck. It turns out “Cabbage Coins” is catchy, a little bit silly, and very hard to forget — which customers and podcast viewers seem to agree with.</p>
